<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner wins Hong Kong sewage contract.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner wins Hong Kong sewage contract.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kvaerner ASA said on Thursday Kvaerner Construction, in cooperation with Gammon Construction, had been awarded a contract to expand the sewage network in the central and western parts of Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The contract, awarded by the Hong Kong local authorities, is worth at least 430 million crowns, the company said in a statement to the Oslo bourse.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
